"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T04:19:20-08:00","id":25731,"title":"","content":"Not sure if the doc's been edited in response to this thread but you can maintain your hellbeast for a trickle of daily Aether.<br /> <br /> An easy houserule is that instead of dying the cryptid just reverts to normal, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T07:54:48-08:00","id":26503,"title":"","content":"I don't think Interlocks work with Exploit, tho...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T10:07:01-08:00","id":26568,"title":"","content":"Largely offhand\u2026<br /> <br /> Lily Turtledove, who taught birds to sing and Fell from what came next.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Cipher: [apropos koan concerning the nature of companionship and animals, possibly referencing the Biblical Adam's role as namer of the animals]<br /> [Explanation that Lily, who is a Guardian Inquisitor who does a brisk trade in minor Cover pacts, learns Interlocks that involve &quot;pet&quot; animals of various types.]<br /> Animal Messenger &gt; Tag &amp; Release &gt; Animal Communication &gt; Quick Change<br /> <br /> Man's Best Friend<br /> Animal Messenger &gt; Tag &amp; Release<br /> Presence + Animal Ken vs animal's Resolve<br /> [Resolve] Aether<br /> Applies the Bonded Condition to a tagged animal and allows the demon to share its senses and speak through it. The demon can have as many instances of this Interlock active as they can maintain Covers.<br /> <br /> Birds of a Feather<br /> Tag &amp; Release &gt; Animal Communication<br /> Stamina + Animal Ken + 2 vs animal's Stamina<br /> [Stamina] Aether<br /> Transforms a Bonded animal into a Hellbeast with no Aetheric upkeep, the Aether Eater and Aether Hive Adaptations and one Demonic Form ability from the demon's own form (which may shift as the demon's form evolves). The demon may command the animal at any distance, and for the purposes of the Bonded Condition, the animal always counts as being in the demon's presence. A Hellbeast created with this Interlock may have a Rank of up to half of the demon's Primum, rounded up.<br /> <br /> Wolf in Sheep's Clothing<br /> Animal Communication &gt; Quick Change<br /> Wits + Survival<br /> [Size difference +1] Aether<br /> Allows the demon to change the species of a Bonded Hellbeast or disguise its tells so that it looks like a mundane animal of its type. Bonded Hellbeasts now have two of the demon's form powers, which are unavailable while it is disguised as a normal animal, though it may shed its disguise at will.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 12-09-2013, 04:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T10:48:31-08:00","id":27308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/24939-society-for-prevention-of-cruelty-to-mutants-making-hellhound-less-cruel-to-target?p=26503#post26503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think Interlocks work with Exploit, tho...</div> </div> </div> </div>Normally, no, but certainly if you had, like, Animal Messenger and maybe On the Mend or Interference or something in your Cipher, I can see an Interlock making Hellhounds easier to sustain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}